Third-party data
----------------
- Default palette (src/core/default-palette.ts): the 256 colours of the
  MagicaVoxel default palette, by ephtracy, kept so that .vox files without a
  palette read the same as in MagicaVoxel. MagicaVoxel is not affiliated with
  this project. The permission to use these values has not been confirmed in
  writing; a palette of the project's own would remove the question.

Dependencies are listed in package.json; each is under its own licence
(MIT or similar), found in node_modules after installation.
